OL,3,ABurnham joined by former PMs at
OL,4,AWiddecombe service
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham was joined by former prime
OL,7,Fministers as he attended a memorial
OL,8,Fservice for the late politician Ann
OL,9,FWiddecombe.
OL,11,FHundreds gathered for the Service of
OL,12,FRemembrance at Westminster Cathedral on
OL,13,FThursday afternoon, including David
OL,14,FCameron, Liz Truss, Boris Johnson and
OL,15,FRishi Sunak.
OL,17,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood, Reform
OL,18,FUK leader Nigel Farage and deputy
OL,19,Fleader Richard Tice, along with former
OL,20,FConservative Chancellor Philip Hammond
OL,21,Fand Speaker of the House of Commons Sir
OL,22,FLindsay Hoyle, were also in attendance.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
